      "questionHtml": "<div class=\"res_question_text\">\n<div class=\"q-source-tag\"><strong>⚡ GO Classes CS 2027 Style | Pushdown Automata</strong></div>\n<p>Which of the following languages can be accepted by a <strong>Deterministic Pushdown Automaton (DPDA)</strong> by empty stack?</p>\n<div class=\"solution-explanation-panel\" style=\"margin-top: 1.25rem; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.08); border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-primary);\">\n  <strong style=\"color: var(--accent-primary);\">💡 Official Solution & Step-by-Step Derivation:</strong>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 0.95rem;\">\n    $\\{a^n b^n\\}$ has the prefix property if marked or can be accepted by empty stack. $\\{ww^R\\}$ requires non-determinism to guess the midpoint, so it cannot be accepted by a DPDA.\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "html": "<span>$\\{ a^n b^n \\mid n \\ge 1 \\}$</span>",
          "textHtml": "<span>$\\{ a^n b^n \\mid n \\ge 1 \\}$</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "html": "<span>$\\{ w w^R \\mid w \\in \\{a, b\\}^* \\}$</span>",
          "textHtml": "<span>$\\{ w w^R \\mid w \\in \\{a, b\\}^* \\}$</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "html": "<span>$\\{ a^n b^m c^n \\mid n, m \\ge 1 \\}$</span>",
          "textHtml": "<span>$\\{ a^n b^m c^n \\mid n, m \\ge 1 \\}$</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
